                  "type": "string",
                  "const": "bounce",
                  "description": "Spring 160 / 10 / 1 with `bounce` (ζ ≈ 0.40): each bounce about a quarter as high."
                }
              ],
              "description": "A named easing (keyframes §4.6): one of the 21 presets, or `linear` or `hold`. Commands\naccept it instead of an [`Interp`] (`easing: \"ease_out\"`) and expand it on write\n([`Easing::interp`]); documents never store the name alone.\n\nThe table is part of the spec: changing a preset's numbers means a new name, because\ndocuments store the expanded numbers and old projects must never change appearance."
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "A preset name, `linear` or `hold`.",
          "default": null
        }
